  "type": "numerical",
  "level": 3,
  "question": {
    "text": "The distance of centre of mass from end <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math> of a one dimensional rod <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> having mass density <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#961;</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>&#961;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kg</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> and length <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>L</mi></math> (in meter) is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>L</mi></mrow><mi>&#945;</mi></mfrac><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math>. The value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi></math> is _____ (where <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math> is the distance form end <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math>)",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "8",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given here:</p><p>Mass density,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#961;</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>&#961;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kg</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p>Let us suppose there is an element of length&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>d</mo><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;at a distance <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math> from left must end.</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/8c1eb38f-fe25-4a1a-ac53-5bdf818421a2-image.png\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 73px;\" /></p><p>Mass of this element is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>d</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>&#961;</mi><mo>d</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>&#961;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>The centre of mass of this element is&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi><mi>cm</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>&#8747;</mo><mi>xdm</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>&#8747;</mo><mi>dm</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>&#961;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>l</mi></msubsup><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi>x</mi><mo>d</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><msubsup><mo>&#8747;</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>l</mi></msubsup><msub><mi>&#961;</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>d</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfrac><msup><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>L</mi><mn>4</mn></msup><mrow><mn>4</mn><msup><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><msup><mi>L</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mrow><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><msup><mi>L</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mstyle><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>L</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mstyle></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>L</mi></mrow><mn>8</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Hence, the value of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></math>.</p></blockquote>",
    "image": null
  },
